#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "See which channels exist: choose View > Channel List, or type %{command}."
msgstr "查看有哪些頻道:選擇「檢視 > 頻道列表」,或輸入 %{command}。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:128
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Shortcut Cheatsheet"
msgstr "快速鍵速查表"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:127
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Start Menu"
msgstr "開始選單"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:114
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Text Formatting"
msgstr "文字格式"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:52
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Status tab collects server messages, such as the Message of the Day."
msgstr "「狀態」分頁會收集伺服器訊息,例如每日訊息。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The menu bar and the Start menu open every window and tool, from the Channel List to your account settings."
msgstr "選單列和開始選單可開啟所有視窗和工具,從頻道列表到你的帳號設定。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The nicklist shows who is in the current channel."
msgstr "暱稱列表會顯示目前頻道中有哪些人。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:46
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The topic bar above the messages shows the channel topic and its modes."
msgstr "訊息上方的主題列會顯示頻道主題及其模式。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:95
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "These help pages are always one click away. Choose Help > Help Topics in the chat to open them. Good places to start:"
msgstr "這些說明頁面隨時都能開啟。在聊天中選擇「說明 > 說明主題」即可開啟。建議從這裡開始:"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:102
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "UI Overview"
msgstr "介面概覽"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:93
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where to look next"
msgstr "接下來看哪裡"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Your nickname"
msgstr "你的暱稱"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:115
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "covers bold text, colors and Markdown."
msgstr "介紹粗體文字、顏色和 Markdown。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:103
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "explains each part of the screen."
msgstr "說明畫面上每個部分的功能。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:119
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "explains how your nickname is protected."
msgstr "說明你的暱稱如何受到保護。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:107
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "lists everything you can type."
msgstr "列出你可以輸入的所有指令。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:111
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "shows how to talk to one person."
msgstr "示範如何與一個人聊天。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Talk to one person in private:"
msgstr "與一個人私下聊天:"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:29
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every nickname is registered with a password. The first time you use a new nickname, the connect screen asks you to choose a password."
msgstr "每個暱稱都以密碼註冊。你第一次使用新暱稱時,連線畫面會請你設定一組密碼。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "On later visits, enter the same password to log in."
msgstr "之後再來時,輸入相同的密碼即可登入。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/welcome.html.heex:33
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Then click %{button}."
msgstr "然後點擊 %{button}。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "\"Alice\" and \"alice\" are the same nickname."
msgstr "「Alice」和「alice」是相同的暱稱。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:23
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Capital letters do not matter"
msgstr "大寫字母不重要"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:26
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It is shown as you type it."
msgstr "輸入時會直接顯示。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:70
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Everybody in a channel sees its visitors under Visitors, at the foot of the user list, and counted in the number beside the channel. A visitor is not a member: they cannot write, have no role, and leave the list when they close the tab."
msgstr "頻道裡的每個人都能在使用者列表底部的「訪客」下看到訪客,頻道旁的數字也會計入訪客。訪客不是成員:他們不能發言、沒有身分,關閉分頁後就會從列表中消失。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:84
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Guest names are reserved: nobody can register one or change to one"
msgstr "訪客名稱為保留名稱:任何人都不能註冊或改用這類名稱"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:28
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Open other channels from the sidebar, from Browse all, or from a #channel link in a message"
msgstr "從側邊欄、「瀏覽全部」或訊息中的 #channel 連結開啟其他頻道"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:25
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Read the public channels as they happen, and scroll back through them"
msgstr "即時閱讀公開頻道,並可往回捲動查看"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:78
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Secret, private, invite-only and keyed channels cannot be watched — a channel that becomes one closes for its visitors"
msgstr "祕密、私人、僅限邀請和設有金鑰的頻道無法觀看——頻道若變成這類頻道,訪客的頻道就會關閉"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:34
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "See who is in each channel, and close a channel's tab when you are done"
msgstr "查看每個頻道中有哪些人,看完後可關閉該頻道的分頁"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:49
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Taking part"
msgstr "參與聊天"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:68
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Visitors in the user list"
msgstr "使用者列表中的訪客"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:74
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Watching Without an Account"
msgstr "無需帳號即可觀看"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:22
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What you can do"
msgstr "你可以做什麼"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/connecting.html.heex:16
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Cannot be a visitor name such as %{example}"
msgstr "不能使用 %{example} 這類訪客名稱"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:75
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Limits"
msgstr "限制"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:57
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Everything that does something needs an account: writing, reacting, the menus and settings, games, calls, spaces, private sessions — and following any link, whether to a game or to another site. Each of them opens the Connect window instead, saying which feature it was."
msgstr "任何需要實際操作的功能都需要帳號:發言、回應、選單和設定、遊戲、通話、空間、私人對話,以及點擊任何連結,不論是前往遊戲還是其他網站。這些操作都會改為開啟連線視窗,並告訴你是哪項功能。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:63
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "A link to a game, a call or a space opens the chat with that window, and after you sign in it takes you to the link."
msgstr "遊戲、通話或空間的連結會開啟聊天並顯示該視窗,登入後會帶你前往該連結。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:55
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It behaves like every other window: move it, minimize it, or bring it back from its taskbar button. Closing it takes you back to the chat; after signing in you land where you were going — the channel you were reading, or the game or call that asked you to sign in."
msgstr "它和其他視窗一樣:可以移動、最小化,或從工作列按鈕叫回來。關閉後會回到聊天;登入後你會回到原本要去的地方——你正在閱讀的頻道,或是要求你登入的遊戲或通話。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:43
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Share a channel: its address is /c/ followed by its name, and the address bar shows it while the channel is in front"
msgstr "分享頻道:其網址為 /c/ 加上頻道名稱,頻道在最前方時,網址列就會顯示該網址"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "The Connect window is where you sign in. It opens over the chat at its own address, /connect — from Create an account on the home, or from anything you try that needs an account — so you sign in without leaving the desktop you arrived on."
msgstr "連線視窗就是你登入的地方。它會在聊天畫面上方以自己的網址 /connect 開啟——從首頁的「建立帳號」,或從你嘗試的任何需要帳號的操作開啟——這樣你不必離開目前的桌面就能登入。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:51
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Where the message box would be, a bar says you are watching as a visitor. Its Create an account to talk button opens the Connect window, and once you sign in you come back to the same channel."
msgstr "原本訊息輸入框的位置會出現一個列,說明你正以訪客身分觀看。其中的「建立帳號以聊天」按鈕會開啟連線視窗,登入後你會回到同一個頻道。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "At the bottom of the conversation, a System line greets you by your guest name."
msgstr "在對話的最下方,一則系統訊息會以你的訪客名稱向你問好。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:17
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Each feature it names opens its help topic."
msgstr "點選每個功能名稱,就會開啟對應的說明主題。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:13
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It shows how to move between channels and what an account opens, with a button to create one."
msgstr "它會說明如何在頻道之間切換,以及帳號可以開啟哪些內容,並附有建立帳號的按鈕。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:20
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every visit greets you again."
msgstr "每次造訪都會再次向你問候。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:19
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "It goes away when you open another channel."
msgstr "當你開啟另一個頻道時,它就會消失。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:18
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Only you see it."
msgstr "只有你看得到。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:37
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Read what every member reads on arrival: the message of the day in Status, and a channel's welcome when you open it"
msgstr "閱讀每位成員抵達時都會看到的內容:狀態中的每日訊息,以及開啟頻道時的頻道歡迎詞"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:9
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Type a nickname and click Continue. A nickname nobody has registered opens a short registration form; a registered one asks for its password. Either way you land in the chat already identified."
msgstr "輸入暱稱並按一下「繼續」。尚無人註冊的暱稱會開啟簡短的註冊表單;已註冊的暱稱則會要求輸入密碼。無論哪種方式,你進入聊天時都已完成身分驗證。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:31
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "What each terminal is — its browser, its system, when it was last used — is in Trusted Terminals, in the Start menu."
msgstr "每個終端的詳細資訊——它的瀏覽器、系統,以及上次使用的時間——都在「開始」選單的「信任的終端」中。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:27
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Log in with another nickname opens an empty field, and Back to the list goes back."
msgstr "「使用其他暱稱登入」會開啟空白欄位,「返回列表」則會回到列表。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:21
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Tick Remember this terminal when you log in, and this browser remembers your nickname. Next time, the window lists your nicknames instead of an empty field. Click Log in beside one and you are in, without a password."
msgstr "登入時勾選「記住此終端」,此瀏覽器就會記住你的暱稱。下次開啟時,視窗會列出你的暱稱,而不是空白欄位。按一下暱稱旁的「登入」,就能直接進入,無需密碼。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:48
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "After you disconnect, or when a session ends, this window opens instead of the chat. Auto-login starts again when you close the browser, or when you log in here."
msgstr "中斷連線後,或工作階段結束時,會開啟此視窗而不是聊天。關閉瀏覽器或在此登入後,自動登入會再次啟用。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/ui_connect_window.html.heex:44
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Auto-login is set per terminal and per nickname, so a shared computer can stay manual."
msgstr "自動登入是依每個終端和每個暱稱分別設定的,因此共用的電腦可以維持手動登入。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:90
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Every tab of your browser has the same guest name, and no other visitor has it"
msgstr "你瀏覽器的每個分頁都使用相同的訪客名稱,其他訪客不會有這個名稱"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:2
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "You do not need an account to look around. Open the chat and you land in #lobby with the conversation arriving live, under a guest name such as %{guest}."
msgstr "你不需要帳號就能到處看看。開啟聊天後,你會以訪客名稱(例如 %{guest})進入 #lobby,並即時看到對話內容。"

#: lib/retro_hex_chat_web/controllers/help_content/watching_without_account.html.heex:95
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
msgid "Nothing is kept for a visitor; a new visit gets a new guest name"
msgstr "系統不會為訪客保留任何資料;下次造訪會得到新的訪客名稱"

